    "description": "The Point-Blank <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Range\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Range\">Range</a> of any <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Rifle\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Rifle\">Rifle</a> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Carbine\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Carbine\">Carbine</a> you use is increased by 5 squares. Short <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Range\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Range\">Range</a> for the Weapon begins 5 squares later, but still ends at the same distance. You can take this Talent up to two times; each time you take this Talent, you increase the Point-Blank <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Range\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Range\">Range</a> of any <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Rifle\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Rifle\">Rifle</a> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Carbine\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Carbine\">Carbine</a> you use by an additional 5 squares, up to a maximum of 10 squares.",
